/**
 * EveryJob icon system - Part B (dashboard rebuild): one icon family app-wide.
 *
 * Phosphor Icons (ISC licence, see docs/LICENSES.md), vendored as SVG
 * components in ./icons/phosphor.tsx (generated by scripts/gen-icons.mjs).
 * Import icons from here - never from 'lucide-react' directly.
 *
 * Lucide-compatible aliases keep existing call sites working: the same
 * component names accept size/className/strokeWidth. `weight="duotone"`
 * renders outline + soft fill for active/status icons.
 */
